#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.cron.rst:2
msgid "flowing.plugins.cron package"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.cron package"

#: flowing.plugins.cron:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins.cron`` —— 定时扩展子包。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins.cron`` —— the cron (scheduled task) extension subpackage."

#: flowing.plugins.cron:3 of
msgid ""
"本包承载定时扩展的全部公开符号：:class:`CronPlugin`（工具注册插件）、 :func:`use_cron`（per-Agent "
"启用）、:class:`CronJob`（定时任务记录）、 "
":class:`CronFireContext`（``on_cron_trigger`` 钩子 value），以及模块级 任务 "
"API（:func:`schedule` / :func:`unschedule` / :func:`jobs`）。对外 API 经本 "
"``__init__`` 统一再导出。"
msgstr ""
"This package hosts all public symbols of the cron extension: :class:`CronPlugin` (the tool-registration "
"plugin), :func:`use_cron` (per-Agent enablement), :class:`CronJob` (cron job record), "
":class:`CronFireContext` (the value of the ``on_cron_trigger`` hook), and the module-level job "
"API (:func:`schedule` / :func:`unschedule` / :func:`jobs`). The public API is uniformly "
"re-exported through this ``__init__``."

#: flowing.plugins.cron:9 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.cron`（插件与 ``use_cron``）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs`（任务运行时与模块 API）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.models`（数据对象）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.tools`（LLM 工具）"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.cron` (plugin and ``use_cron``), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs` (job runtime and module API), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.models` (data objects), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.tools` (LLM tools)"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.CronPlugin:1 of
msgid "定时扩展插件——只注册两件 LLM 工具，无 Runtime 级服务。"
msgstr "The cron extension plugin — registers only two LLM tools; no Runtime-level services."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.CronPlugin:3 of
msgid ""
"``runtime.install(CronPlugin())`` 时框架调用 ``install(runtime)``： "
"``runtime.register_tool`` 注册 ``schedule-cron`` / ``manage-cron``。 不 "
"provide、不创建调度器、不挂状态持久化（``cron_jobs`` 键是 ``use_cron`` 的 per-Agent 声明）。"
msgstr ""
"On ``runtime.install(CronPlugin())`` the framework calls ``install(runtime)``: "
"``runtime.register_tool`` registers ``schedule-cron`` / ``manage-cron``. It does not "
"provide anything, create a scheduler, or attach state persistence (the ``cron_jobs`` key is a per-Agent declaration of ``use_cron``)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.CronPlugin:9 flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:19
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext:12
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob:13
#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ManageCronTool:10
#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool:14 of
msgid "行为要点"
msgstr "Key Behaviors"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.CronPlugin:10 of
msgid ""
"安装与否不影响 ``use_cron`` 与模块 API 的可用性——工具只是 LLM 入口（Agent 仍需 ``add_tool`` 才对 "
"LLM 暴露）。"
msgstr ""
"Installing or not does not affect the availability of ``use_cron`` and the module API — the tools are merely the LLM "
"entry point (an Agent still needs ``add_tool`` to expose them to the LLM)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.CronPlugin:12 of
msgid "无收尾资源：定时器全部在 Agent 侧（随 destroy 取消）， ``shutdown`` 无事可做。"
msgstr "There are no resources to wind down: all timers live on the Agent side (cancelled on destroy), so ``shutdown`` has nothing to do."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronPlugin.name:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.CronPlugin.name:1 of
msgid "插件注册名（``runtime.get_plugin(\"cron\")`` 查询用）。"
msgstr "The plugin registration name (used by ``runtime.get_plugin(\"cron\")`` lookups)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronPlugin.dependencies:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.CronPlugin.dependencies:1 of
msgid "无依赖声明。"
msgstr "No dependency declarations."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.CronPlugin.install:1 of
msgid "注册两件 LLM 工具（install 只注册，不读取任何持久状态）。"
msgstr "Registers the two LLM tools (install only registers; it does not read any persistent state)."

