#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:1 of
msgid "为 Agent 实例启用定时能力（``setup()`` 中调用，每实例恰好一次）。"
msgstr "Enable cron capability for an Agent instance (called in ``setup()``, exactly once per instance)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:4 flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:4
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext:4
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob:4
#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ManageCronTool:4
#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool:4 of
msgid "功能介绍"
msgstr "Overview"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:5 of
msgid "完成四件事："
msgstr "It does four things:"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:7 of
msgid ""
"``agent.state.register(\"cron_jobs\", [])``——登记任务总表状态键 （缺省即写、幂等），此后 "
"``agent.state.cron_jobs`` 恒存在；"
msgstr ""
"``agent.state.register(\"cron_jobs\", [])`` — registers the master job-list state key (writes the default "
"on registration, idempotent); from then on ``agent.state.cron_jobs`` always exists;"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:9 of
msgid ""
"``agent.hooks.declare(\"on_cron_trigger\", by=\"cron\", "
"match_on=\"source\")``——声明实例级钩子点（handler 按 value 顶层 ``source`` 字段 fnmatch"
" 过滤注册）；"
msgstr ""
"``agent.hooks.declare(\"on_cron_trigger\", by=\"cron\", "
"match_on=\"source\")`` — declares the instance-level hook point (handlers register with fnmatch "
"filtering on the value's top-level ``source`` field);"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:12 of
msgid "建立任务运行时并挂在内部槽位 ``agent._cron``（只持定时器句柄， 不持任务数据镜像——数据以总表为唯一真相）；"
msgstr "Builds the job runtime and attaches it to the internal slot ``agent._cron`` (it holds only timer handles, not a data mirror of the jobs — the master list is the single source of truth);"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:14 of
msgid ""
"挂 ``after_recover``（by=\"cron\"：读总表补发过期 + 重建定时器） 与 "
"``before_destroy``（by=\"cron\"：取消全部定时器句柄；任务记录 留总表随 session 存续，miss "
"由下次恢复补发）。"
msgstr ""
"Attaches ``after_recover`` (by=\"cron\": re-deliver overdue jobs from the master list + rebuild timers) and "
"``before_destroy`` (by=\"cron\": cancel all timer handles; job records stay in the master list and persist "
"with the session; misses are re-delivered on the next recovery)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:20 of
msgid "**不设防**：每实例恰好执行一次；同一实例重复调用属编程错误 （handler 重复挂载），后果自负，不提供幂等保证。"
msgstr "**Not guarded**: must run exactly once per instance; calling it again on the same instance is a programming error (handlers would be attached twice) — do so at your own risk; no idempotence guarantee is provided."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:22 of
msgid "不注册任何任务（按需注册）；不依赖 ``CronPlugin`` 安装；不为 Agent 声明任何其他资源。"
msgstr "Registers no jobs (jobs are registered on demand); does not depend on ``CronPlugin`` being installed; declares no other resources for the Agent."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:24 of
msgid "恢复路径：``setup()`` 在新实例上执行，本函数以新实例为起点展开 ——声明与挂载不跨实例叠加。"
msgstr "Recovery path: ``setup()`` runs on the new instance, and this function unfolds from that new instance — declarations and attachments do not stack across instances."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:26 of
msgid "零开销不变量：未调用的 Agent 无钩子点、无运行时槽、无定时器。"
msgstr "Zero-overhead invariant: an Agent that never calls it has no hook point, no runtime slot, and no timers."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:28 of
msgid "目标 Agent 实例。"
msgstr "The target Agent instance."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron.use_cron:30 of
msgid ""
":class:`CronPlugin`、:mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs`、 "
":meth:`CronJob`、:meth:`CronFireContext`"
msgstr ""
":class:`CronPlugin`, :mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs`, "
":meth:`CronJob`, :meth:`CronFireContext`"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob:1 of
msgid "一条定时任务——“cron 表达式 + 推送内容”的持久化单元。"
msgstr "A single cron job — the persistence unit of \"cron expression + content to push\"."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob:5 of
msgid ""
"描述“什么时候、给 Agent 推一条什么消息”：``cron`` 是触发节奏， ``content`` 是到点推送的消息文本（可含 "
"``{{current_time}}`` 占位符），``source`` 是供 ``on_cron_trigger`` 钩子 pattern "
"分组过滤 的语义标签。任务由 Agent 逐智能体携带，以 ``cron_jobs`` 状态键 "
"（``list[dict]``）写透落盘；对象本体只在读侧按需重建，运行期不留 数据镜像。"
msgstr ""
"Describes \"when to push which message to the Agent\": ``cron`` is the trigger cadence, ``content`` is the "
"message text pushed at the due time (may contain ``{{current_time}}`` placeholders), and ``source`` is a "
"semantic label used for pattern-based filtering by the ``on_cron_trigger`` hook. Jobs are carried per agent "
"and written through to disk under the ``cron_jobs`` state key (``list[dict]``); the object itself is rebuilt "
"on demand on the read side, with no data mirror kept at runtime."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob:14 of
msgid ""
"纯数据容器：无构造校验、无 ``__post_init__``——不变式（content 非空、cron 可解析、job_id "
"不冲突、占位符格式合法）由注册 API :func:`flowing.plugins.cron.schedule` 在注册边界维护。"
msgstr ""
"A pure data container: no constructor validation, no ``__post_init__`` — the invariants (non-empty content, "
"parseable cron, no job_id conflicts, legal placeholder formats) are maintained at the registration boundary "
"by the registration API :func:`flowing.plugins.cron.schedule`."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob:17 of
msgid ""
"``source`` 不进消息文本，只服务钩子过滤与 EVENT 消息来源标识； 空串表示“未设标签”（对非 ``\"*\"`` 的钩子 "
"pattern 不命中）。"
msgstr ""
"``source`` does not go into the message text; it only serves hook filtering and the source identity of EVENT "
"messages; an empty string means \"no label\" (does not match hook patterns other than ``\"*\"``)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob:19 of
msgid "``recurring=False`` 表示一次性任务：第一次成功交付后自移除； 到点未交付（被跳过）不算成功交付，不移除。"
msgstr "``recurring=False`` means a one-shot job: it removes itself after the first successful delivery; a due time that was not delivered (skipped) does not count as successful delivery and does not remove it."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob:21 of
msgid ""
"时间字段为系统本地 naive ``datetime``（不做时区归一化）； ``last_fired_at=None`` "
"表示从未交付（合并计数基数退化为 ``created_at``）。"
msgstr ""
"Time fields are system-local naive ``datetime`` values (no timezone normalization); ``last_fired_at=None`` "
"means never delivered (the coalescing-count base degenerates to ``created_at``)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob:25 of
msgid ":class:`CronFireContext`、:mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs`"
msgstr ":class:`CronFireContext`, :mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs`"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronJob.id:1 flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob.id:1
#: of
msgid "任务 ID（该 Agent 作用域内唯一；注册时缺省生成 8 位随机 hex）。"
msgstr "Job ID (unique within the scope of this Agent; an 8-character random hex is generated by default at registration)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronJob.cron:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob.cron:1 of
msgid "五字段 cron 表达式（``分 时 日 月 周``，分精度），按系统本地 时刻解释。"
msgstr "Five-field cron expression (``minute hour day month weekday``, minute precision), interpreted against the system local clock."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronJob.content:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob.content:1 of
msgid "到点推送的消息文本；可含 ``{{current_time}}`` 占位符。"
msgstr "The message text pushed at the due time; may contain ``{{current_time}}`` placeholders."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronJob.created_at:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob.created_at:1 of
msgid "创建时间（系统本地 naive）；从未交付任务的合并计数基数。"
msgstr "Creation time (system-local naive); the coalescing-count base for never-delivered jobs."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronJob.source:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob.source:1 of
msgid ""
"语义标签：``on_cron_trigger`` 钩子的 ``match_on=\"source\"`` 过滤 字段（fnmatch），也是 "
"EVENT 消息来源（空串时消息 source 落 ``\"cron\"``）。不进消息文本。"
msgstr ""
"Semantic label: the ``match_on=\"source\"`` filter field (fnmatch) of the ``on_cron_trigger`` hook, and "
"also the EVENT message source (when empty, the message source falls back to ``\"cron\"``). Does not go into "
"the message text."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronJob.recurring:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob.recurring:1 of
msgid "``False`` = 一次性任务：第一次成功交付后自移除（写透落盘）。"
msgstr "``False`` = one-shot job: removes itself after the first successful delivery (written through to disk)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronJob.last_fired_at:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob.last_fired_at:1 of
msgid "上次成功交付时刻（系统本地 naive）。合并计数游标：只在成功交付 时推进；``None`` 表示从未交付。"
msgstr "Time of the last successful delivery (system-local naive). The coalescing-count cursor: advances only on successful delivery; ``None`` means never delivered."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob.to_dict:1 of
msgid "序列化为 JSON 可化纯 dict——进出 ``cron_jobs`` 状态键的写通道。"
msgstr "Serialize to a plain JSON-able dict — the write channel in and out of the ``cron_jobs`` state key."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob.to_dict:3 of
msgid "字段平铺；时间为 ISO 8601 字符串（``None`` 保持 ``None``）； ``source`` 恒写出（空串也写，落盘结构自描述）。"
msgstr "Fields are flattened; times are ISO 8601 strings (``None`` stays ``None``); ``source`` is always written (even an empty string, so the on-disk structure is self-describing)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronJob.from_dict:1 of
msgid "从落盘 dict 重建（纯字段映射，不做领域校验——盘即数据源）。"
msgstr "Rebuild from an on-disk dict (pure field mapping, no domain validation — the disk is the data source)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext:1 of
msgid "``on_cron_trigger`` 钩子点的 value——一次即将交付的触发视图。"
msgstr "The value of the ``on_cron_trigger`` hook point — a view of one imminent delivery."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext:5 of
msgid ""
"任务到点（或恢复补发）时，交付例程先构造本对象并 ``agent.hooks.on_cron_trigger.dispatch(agent, "
"ctx)``，随后才组装并 入队消息。handler 可改写 ``ctx.content``（仅本次生效，不落盘）或置 "
"``ctx.shortcut = True`` 跳过本次推送；``raise Intercepted`` 硬阻断 语义同 "
"shortcut（游标不推进，miss 继续累积）。"
msgstr ""
"When a job comes due (or is re-delivered on recovery), the delivery routine first constructs this object and calls "
"``agent.hooks.on_cron_trigger.dispatch(agent, ctx)``, and only then assembles and enqueues the message. "
"A handler may rewrite ``ctx.content`` (effective for this delivery only, not persisted) or set "
"``ctx.shortcut = True`` to skip this push; ``raise Intercepted`` has the same hard-blocking semantics as "
"shortcut (the cursor does not advance and misses keep accumulating)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext:13 of
msgid ""
"``match_on=\"source\"``：钩子按 value 顶层 ``source`` 字段做 fnmatch 过滤（pattern "
"注册形态）。"
msgstr ""
"``match_on=\"source\"``: hooks filter with fnmatch on the value's top-level ``source`` field (handlers "
"register with patterns)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext:15 of
msgid ""
"``coalesced_count`` 为 ``(last_fired_at ?? created_at, fired_at]`` "
"区间内理想触发次数：``== 1`` 为到点裸发；``>= 2`` 为错过多次的 合并补发（文案走唯一补发模板）。"
msgstr ""
"``coalesced_count`` is the number of ideal firings in the interval ``(last_fired_at ?? created_at, fired_at]``: "
"``== 1`` is a plain on-time firing; ``>= 2`` is a coalesced re-delivery after multiple misses (the text uses "
"the single re-delivery template)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext:18 of
msgid ""
"``content`` 初值为任务原文（未做 ``{{current_time}}`` 替换）； 替换发生在组装阶段，handler "
"改写后的文本同样会被替换。"
msgstr ""
"The initial value of ``content`` is the job's original text (without ``{{current_time}}`` substitution); "
"substitution happens during the assembly phase, and text rewritten by a handler is substituted as well."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext:21 of
msgid ":class:`CronJob`、:func:`flowing.plugins.cron.use_cron`"
msgstr ":class:`CronJob`, :func:`flowing.plugins.cron.use_cron`"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronFireContext.id:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext.id:1 of
msgid "任务 ID（= ``job.id``）。"
msgstr "Job ID (= ``job.id``)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronFireContext.source:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext.source:1 of
msgid "任务语义标签（= ``job.source``）——钩子 pattern 过滤字段。"
msgstr "The job's semantic label (= ``job.source``) — the hook pattern filter field."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronFireContext.cron:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext.cron:1 of
msgid "任务 cron 表达式（只读）。"
msgstr "The job's cron expression (read-only)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronFireContext.content:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext.content:1 of
msgid "本次将推送的文本（初值 ``job.content`` 原文；handler 可改写， 仅本次生效，不落盘）。"
msgstr "The text to be pushed this time (initial value is the original ``job.content``; a handler may rewrite it, effective for this delivery only, not persisted)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronFireContext.recurring:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext.recurring:1 of
msgid "任务是否周期（只读）。"
msgstr "Whether the job is recurring (read-only)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronFireContext.scheduled_at:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext.scheduled_at:1 of
msgid "区间内最后一个理想触发点（本次交付对应的理想时刻）。"
msgstr "The last ideal firing point in the interval (the ideal time this delivery corresponds to)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronFireContext.fired_at:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext.fired_at:1 of
msgid "实际交付时刻（系统本地 naive）。"
msgstr "The actual delivery time (system-local naive)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronFireContext.coalesced_count:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext.coalesced_count:1 of
msgid "区间内理想触发次数（含本次），``>= 1``。"
msgstr "Number of ideal firings in the interval (including this one), ``>= 1``."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronFireContext.last_fired_at:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext.last_fired_at:1 of
msgid "上次成功交付时刻（交付前游标）；``None`` = 从未交付。"
msgstr "Time of the last successful delivery (the pre-delivery cursor); ``None`` = never delivered."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.CronFireContext.shortcut:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.models.CronFireContext.shortcut:1 of
msgid "跳过标记（初值 ``None``）。任一 handler 置 ``True`` 即跳过本次 推送（不推进游标，miss 继续累积）。"
msgstr "Skip flag (initial value ``None``). Any handler setting it to ``True`` skips this push (the cursor does not advance; misses keep accumulating)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.schedule:1 of
msgid ""
"为 Agent 注册一条定时任务，返回 ``job_id``（详见 "
":meth:`_CronRuntime.schedule`——校验与落盘语义都在该处）。"
msgstr ""
"Register a cron job for an Agent and return the ``job_id`` (see "
":meth:`_CronRuntime.schedule` for details — validation and persistence semantics live there)."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.cron.rst
msgid "抛出"
msgstr "Raises"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.schedule:4 of
msgid "agent 未 ``use_cron``、content 为空、cron 非法、 占位符格式非法或 job_id 冲突时。"
msgstr "When the agent has not called ``use_cron``, content is empty, the cron is invalid, placeholder formats are illegal, or the job_id conflicts."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.unschedule:1 of
msgid "取消 Agent 的一条任务（不存在返回 ``False``）。"
msgstr "Cancel one of the Agent's jobs (returns ``False`` if it does not exist)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.jobs:3 flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.unschedule:3 of
msgid "agent 未 ``use_cron`` 时。"
msgstr "When the agent has not called ``use_cron``."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.jobs:1 of
msgid "Agent 的任务只读快照（``list[CronJob]``）。"
msgstr "A read-only snapshot of the Agent's jobs (``list[CronJob]``)."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.cron.rst:10
msgid "Submodules"
msgstr "Submodules"

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.cron.rst:13
msgid "flowing.plugins.cron.cron module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.cron.cron module"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins.cron`` —— 插件主模块（CronPlugin / use_cron）。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins.cron`` —— the plugin's main module (CronPlugin / use_cron)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:5 of
msgid "定时扩展的启用模型是双层解耦的："
msgstr "The enablement model of the cron extension is decoupled into two layers:"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:7 of
msgid ""
"``runtime.install(CronPlugin())`` 只做一件事：向全局注册表注册两件 LLM 工具（``schedule-"
"cron`` / ``manage-cron``）。不 provide 任何注入键、 不创建任何 Runtime 级服务——任务随 Agent "
"走，不存在中央调度器；"
msgstr ""
"``runtime.install(CronPlugin())`` does exactly one thing: registers the two LLM tools (``schedule-"
"cron`` / ``manage-cron``) into the global registry. It does not provide any inject keys and creates no "
"Runtime-level service — jobs travel with the Agent; there is no central scheduler;"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:10 of
msgid ""
"``use_cron(agent)`` 在 Agent 的 ``setup()`` 中调用，为该实例登记 ``cron_jobs`` 状态键、声明"
" ``on_cron_trigger`` 钩子点、建立任务运行时 并挂生命周期 handler。**不依赖** ``CronPlugin`` "
"是否安装：不装插件时 Agent 仍可编程使用模块 API（``schedule`` / ``unschedule`` / ``jobs``）， "
"只是 LLM 没有工具入口。"
msgstr ""
"``use_cron(agent)`` is called in the Agent's ``setup()``: it registers the ``cron_jobs`` state key for "
"that instance, declares the ``on_cron_trigger`` hook point, builds the job runtime, and attaches lifecycle "
"handlers. It does **not depend** on whether ``CronPlugin`` is installed: without the plugin the Agent can "
"still use the module API programmatically (``schedule`` / ``unschedule`` / ``jobs``); the LLM simply has no "
"tool entry point."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:16 of
msgid ""
"任务注册不在 ``use_cron`` 内：声明式注册写在应用层的 ``after_create`` handler 里（只跑一次），LLM "
"路径经 ``add_tool(\"schedule-cron\")`` 暴露。"
msgstr ""
"Job registration does not live inside ``use_cron``: declarative registration is written in the application "
"layer's ``after_create`` handler (runs only once); the LLM path is exposed via ``add_tool(\"schedule-cron\")``."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:20 of
msgid "注册面清单"
msgstr "Registration Surface"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:21 of
msgid ""
"状态键：``cron_jobs``（``agent.state.register(\"cron_jobs\", [])``—— "
"缺省即写，此后键恒存在，写透到该 Agent 的 ``state.jsonl``）。"
msgstr ""
"State key: ``cron_jobs`` (``agent.state.register(\"cron_jobs\", [])`` — writes the default on "
"registration; the key always exists thereafter and is written through to the Agent's ``state.jsonl``)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:23 of
msgid ""
"钩子点：``on_cron_trigger``（``by=\"cron\"``，``match_on=\"source\"``， 由 "
"``use_cron`` 声明、由交付例程在使用处 dispatch——谁声明谁 dispatch）。"
msgstr ""
"Hook point: ``on_cron_trigger`` (``by=\"cron\"``, ``match_on=\"source\"``; declared by ``use_cron`` "
"and dispatched by the delivery routine at the point of use — whoever declares it dispatches it)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:26 of
msgid ""
"挂载的钩子：``after_recover``（by=\"cron\"：恢复补发 + 重建定时器）、 "
"``before_destroy``（by=\"cron\"：取消全部定时器句柄）。"
msgstr ""
"Attached hooks: ``after_recover`` (by=\"cron\": recovery re-delivery + rebuild timers), "
"``before_destroy`` (by=\"cron\": cancel all timer handles)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:28 of
msgid ""
"未启用的 Agent（未调 ``use_cron``）：无钩子点、无运行时槽、无定时器、 ``state.jsonl`` 无 cron "
"键；对其调模块 API 抛 ``ValueError``。"
msgstr ""
"An Agent that has not enabled cron (never called ``use_cron``): no hook point, no runtime slot, no timers, "
"and no cron key in ``state.jsonl``; calling the module API on it raises ``ValueError``."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:32 of
msgid "使用示例"
msgstr "Examples"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.cron:54 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs`（运行时与模块 API）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.models`（数据对象）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.tools`（LLM 工具）"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs` (job runtime and module API), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.models` (data objects), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.tools` (LLM tools)"

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.cron.rst:21
msgid "flowing.plugins.cron.jobs module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.cron.jobs module"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins.cron.jobs`` —— 任务运行时与模块 API。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins.cron.jobs`` —— the job runtime and module API."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs:3 of
msgid ""
"本模块承载定时扩展的逐智能体运行时：croniter 解析与合并计数、 ``{{current_time}}`` 机械替换、唯一补发模板、每 "
"Agent 的定时器句柄容器， 以及到点/恢复补发共用的统一交付例程。公开的模块 API（ :func:`schedule` / "
":func:`unschedule` / :func:`jobs`）以 ``agent`` 为 首个参数，操作该 Agent "
"的状态总表（``cron_jobs`` 键）。"
msgstr ""
"This module hosts the per-agent runtime of the cron extension: croniter parsing and coalescing counts, "
"mechanical ``{{current_time}}`` substitution, the single re-delivery template, the per-Agent timer-handle "
"container, and the unified delivery routine shared by on-time firing and recovery re-delivery. The public "
"module API (:func:`schedule` / :func:`unschedule` / :func:`jobs`) takes ``agent`` as its first parameter "
"and operates on that Agent's master state list (the ``cron_jobs`` key)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs:10 of
msgid "持久化模型（委托总表）"
msgstr "Persistence Model (Delegated to the Master List)"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs:11 of
msgid ""
"任务的唯一真相是 ``agent.state.cron_jobs``（``use_cron`` 登记、缺省即 "
"写，此后键恒存在）。本模块**不留数据镜像**：每次变更 = “读总表 → 改 → 二次赋值（写透）”；交付例程含 await（钩子 "
"dispatch、消息入队）， 其写回步骤在 await 后**重新读当前总表、只按 id 替换/移除自己那条**， "
"并发到点的多个任务互不覆盖游标。"
msgstr ""
"The single source of truth for jobs is ``agent.state.cron_jobs`` (registered by ``use_cron`` with the "
"default written immediately; the key always exists thereafter). This module keeps **no data mirror**: every "
"change is \"read the master list, modify, reassign (write through)\"; the delivery routine contains awaits "
"(hook dispatch, message enqueue), and its write-back step **re-reads the current master list after the "
"awaits and replaces/removes only its own entry by id**, so multiple jobs coming due concurrently never "
"overwrite each other's cursors."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs:18 of
msgid "时间与占位符"
msgstr "Time and Placeholders"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs:19 of
msgid ""
"全模块唯一时间入口 :func:`_now` = ``datetime.now()``（系统本地 naive， 不做时区归一化）；cron "
"表达式按本地墙钟解释。"
msgstr ""
"The module's single time entry point :func:`_now` = ``datetime.now()`` (system-local naive, no timezone "
"normalization); cron expressions are interpreted against the local wall clock."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs:21 of
msgid ""
"消息文本占位符：``{{current_time}}``（默认格式）与 ``{{current_time:<strftime>}}``；组装时对 "
"content 先做一次机械正则 替换，再决定裸发或套补发模板。非法格式在注册期（:func:`schedule`） 以探针渲染报 "
"``ValueError``，不在触发期爆雷。"
msgstr ""
"Message-text placeholders: ``{{current_time}}`` (default format) and ``{{current_time:<strftime>}}``; "
"during assembly the content gets one mechanical regex substitution first, then the routine decides between "
"a plain send and wrapping it in the re-delivery template. Illegal formats are reported as ``ValueError`` at "
"registration time (:func:`schedule`) via a probe render, so they never blow up at trigger time."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs:26 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron`（扩展整体契约）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.models`（数据对象）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.cron`（插件与 ``use_cron``）"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron` (the extension's overall contract), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.models` (data objects), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.cron` (plugin and ``use_cron``)"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.MISSED_NOTICE:1 of
msgid "唯一补发模板（模块常量，无注入面）：错过多次（``coalesced_count >= 2``） 时渲染的完整消息，自含内容。"
msgstr "The single re-delivery template (a module constant, no injection surface): the complete message rendered when multiple firings were missed (``coalesced_count >= 2``); self-contained content."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.MISSED_NOTICE:4 of
msgid ""
"允许的 token（渲染器按固定顺序 ``str.replace``，不用 ``str.format``—— content 内可含任意花括号与 "
"``{{current_time}}`` 占位符，不受转义影响）："
msgstr ""
"Allowed tokens (the renderer applies ``str.replace`` in a fixed order instead of ``str.format`` — content "
"may contain arbitrary braces and ``{{current_time}}`` placeholders, unaffected by escaping):"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.MISSED_NOTICE:7 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``{count}`` —— 错过次数（十进制）"
msgstr "``{count}`` —— number of misses (decimal)"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.MISSED_NOTICE:8 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``{cron}`` —— 任务 cron 表达式原文"
msgstr "``{cron}`` —— the job's cron expression, verbatim"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.MISSED_NOTICE:9 of
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid "``{last_fired_at}`` —— 上次成功交付时刻（本地 ``%Y-%m-%d %H:%M``； 从未交付渲染“从未交付”）"
msgstr "``{last_fired_at}`` —— time of the last successful delivery (local ``%Y-%m-%d %H:%M``; renders as \"never delivered\" if never delivered)"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.MISSED_NOTICE:11 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``{content}`` —— 本次推送内容（已做 ``{{current_time}}`` 替换）"
msgstr "``{content}`` —— the content pushed this time (``{{current_time}}`` already substituted)"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.MISSED_NOTICE:13 of
msgid "模板不提单一应触发时刻：多次错过没有“某一个本应触发时刻”。"
msgstr "The template does not mention a single expected firing time: with multiple misses there is no \"one time it should have fired\"."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.substitute_current_time:1 of
msgid "把文本内全部 ``{{current_time}}`` 占位符机械替换为 ``now`` 的格式化值。"
msgstr "Mechanically replace all ``{{current_time}}`` placeholders in the text with the formatted value of ``now``."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.substitute_current_time:3 of
msgid ""
"纯正则替换、无 Parsable/Jinja。格式串非法时 ``strftime`` 抛 "
"``ValueError``（注册期探针已挡第一道，触发期不再出现）。"
msgstr ""
"Pure regex substitution, no Parsable/Jinja. An illegal format string makes ``strftime`` raise "
"``ValueError`` (the registration-time probe is the first line of defense; it no longer occurs at trigger time)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.validate_placeholders:1 of
msgid "注册期探针：content 内全部占位符格式做指令集白名单校验。"
msgstr "Registration-time probe: validates all placeholder formats in the content against an instruction whitelist."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.jobs.validate_placeholders:3 of
msgid ""
"格式含白名单外指令（或孤立 ``%``）→ ``ValueError``（配置错误在注册 边界暴露；``strftime`` "
"本身对未知指令不报错，故须显式校验）。"
msgstr ""
"A format containing instructions outside the whitelist (or a lone ``%``) → ``ValueError`` (configuration "
"errors surface at the registration boundary; ``strftime`` itself does not error on unknown instructions, so "
"explicit validation is required)."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.cron.rst:29
msgid "flowing.plugins.cron.models module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.cron.models module"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins.cron.models`` —— 定时扩展的数据对象。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins.cron.models`` —— the data objects of the cron extension."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models:3 of
msgid ""
"本模块定义两个公开数据对象：:class:`CronJob`（一条定时任务，逐智能体 携带的持久化单元）与 "
":class:`CronFireContext`（``on_cron_trigger`` 钩子点的 value——一次即将交付的触发视图）。"
msgstr ""
"This module defines two public data objects: :class:`CronJob` (a single cron job, the persistence unit "
"carried per agent) and :class:`CronFireContext` (the value of the ``on_cron_trigger`` hook point — a view "
"of one imminent delivery)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.models:7 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron`（扩展的整体契约）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs`（任务运行时与模块 API）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.cron`（插件与 ``use_cron``）"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron` (the extension's overall contract), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs` (job runtime and module API), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.cron` (plugin and ``use_cron``)"

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.cron.rst:37
msgid "flowing.plugins.cron.tools module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.cron.tools module"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins.cron.tools`` —— 定时扩展的 LLM 工具。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins.cron.tools`` —— the LLM tools of the cron extension."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools:3 of
msgid ""
"本模块定义两件全局工具：:class:`ScheduleCronTool`（``schedule-cron``， 为调用方注册一条定时消息任务）与"
" :class:`ManageCronTool` （``manage-cron``，查询 / 取消）。由 "
"``CronPlugin.install()`` 注册进 全局工具注册表；任何 Agent 可按需 ``add_tool(...)`` 暴露给 "
"LLM。两件 工具的目标都固定为调用方（``caller``），LLM 不能为其他 Agent 操作任务。"
msgstr ""
"This module defines two global tools: :class:`ScheduleCronTool` (``schedule-cron``, registers a scheduled "
"message job for the caller) and :class:`ManageCronTool` (``manage-cron``, query / cancel). They are "
"registered into the global tool registry by ``CronPlugin.install()``; any Agent can expose them to the LLM "
"on demand via ``add_tool(...)``. Both tools' targets are fixed to the caller (``caller``); the LLM cannot "
"operate on other Agents' jobs."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools:9 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron`（扩展整体契约）、 :mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs`（模块 "
"API 与校验语义）"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron` (the extension's overall contract), :mod:`flowing.plugins.cron.jobs` "
"(module API and validation semantics)"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool:1 of
msgid "全局工具 ``schedule-cron``——为调用方 Agent 注册一条定时消息任务。"
msgstr "The global tool ``schedule-cron`` — registers a scheduled message job for the calling Agent."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool:5 of
msgid ""
"由 ``CronPlugin.install()`` 注册；任何 Agent 可按需 ``add_tool(\"schedule-"
"cron\")`` 暴露给 LLM。目标锁定 ``caller`` （经 ``execute()`` 的 ``caller`` "
"参数由框架注入）。等价于 ``schedule(caller, cron, content, job_id=..., source=..., "
"recurring=...)`` 并包装收据。校验失败（content 空 / cron 非法 / 占位符格式非法 / job_id 冲突）由 "
"``Tool.__call__`` 包装为 ``status=\"error\"`` 的 ``ToolResult``（LLM "
"可见，不触发错误钩子）。"
msgstr ""
"Registered by ``CronPlugin.install()``; any Agent can expose it to the LLM on demand via "
"``add_tool(\"schedule-cron\")``. The target is locked to ``caller`` (injected by the framework through "
"``execute()``'s ``caller`` parameter). Equivalent to ``schedule(caller, cron, content, job_id=..., "
"source=..., recurring=...)`` plus a receipt wrapper. Validation failures (empty content / invalid cron / "
"illegal placeholder formats / job_id conflicts) are wrapped by ``Tool.__call__`` into a ``ToolResult`` "
"with ``status=\"error\"`` (visible to the LLM; does not trigger error hooks)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool:15 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"调用成功返回收据 dict：``{\"job_id\",\"cron\",\"source\",\"recurring\", "
"\"next_fire\"}``（``next_fire`` 为下一理想点 ISO 8601，本地 naive）。"
msgstr ""
"On success returns a receipt dict: ``{\"job_id\",\"cron\",\"source\",\"recurring\", "
"\"next_fire\"}`` (``next_fire`` is the next ideal firing point in ISO 8601, local naive)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool:17 of
msgid ""
"``source`` 为可选语义标签（``on_cron_trigger`` 钩子 pattern 过滤 与 EVENT "
"source）；``job_id`` 可选（显式语义化 id 便于钩子按 精确 id 过滤与 manage-cron 取消）。"
msgstr ""
"``source`` is an optional semantic label (used for ``on_cron_trigger`` hook pattern filtering and as the "
"EVENT source); ``job_id`` is optional (an explicit, meaningful id makes it easier for hooks to filter by "
"exact id and for manage-cron to cancel)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool:21 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.tool.Tool`、:class:`ManageCronTool`、 "
":func:`flowing.plugins.cron.schedule`"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.tool.Tool`, :class:`ManageCronTool`, "
":func:`flowing.plugins.cron.schedule`"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ManageCronTool.definition:1
#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool.definition:1 of
msgid ""
"默认 LLM 声明。类属性或实例属性（`ScriptTool.__init__` 自动生成）。 Agent 级覆写不修改本对象（见 "
"`ToolEntry`）。"
msgstr ""
"The default LLM declaration. A class attribute or instance attribute (auto-generated by "
"`ScriptTool.__init__`). Agent-level overrides do not modify this object (see `ToolEntry`)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool.execute:1 of
msgid "以 ``caller`` 为目标注册任务，返回收据 dict。"
msgstr "Register a job targeting ``caller`` and return the receipt dict."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool.execute:3 of
msgid "五字段 cron 表达式。"
msgstr "A five-field cron expression."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool.execute:4 of
msgid "到点推送的消息文本。"
msgstr "The message text pushed at the due time."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool.execute:5 of
msgid "语义标签；缺省 ``\"\"``。"
msgstr "Semantic label; defaults to ``\"\"``."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool.execute:6 of
msgid "``False`` = 一次性任务。"
msgstr "``False`` = one-shot job."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool.execute:7 of
msgid "显式任务 id（可选）。"
msgstr "Explicit job id (optional)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ManageCronTool.execute:5
#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool.execute:8 of
msgid "调用方 Agent（框架注入，LLM 不可见）。"
msgstr "The calling Agent (injected by the framework, not visible to the LLM)."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.cron.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool.execute:9 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``{\"job_id\",\"cron\",\"source\",\"recurring\",\"next_fire\"}``。"
msgstr "``{\"job_id\",\"cron\",\"source\",\"recurring\",\"next_fire\"}``."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ScheduleCronTool.execute:10 of
msgid "校验失败（经 ``Tool.__call__`` 包装为 error 结果）。"
msgstr "On validation failure (wrapped into an error result by ``Tool.__call__``)."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ManageCronTool:1 of
msgid "全局工具 ``manage-cron``——查询 / 取消调用方自己的定时任务。"
msgstr "The global tool ``manage-cron`` — query / cancel the caller's own cron jobs."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ManageCronTool:5 of
msgid ""
"``action=\"list\"`` 列出 caller 的任务，``action=\"cancel\"`` 按 ``job_id`` "
"取消。目标锁定 caller。校验失败（``cancel`` 缺 ``job_id``）经 ``Tool.__call__`` 包装为 "
"``status=\"error\"`` 结果。"
msgstr ""
"``action=\"list\"`` lists the caller's jobs; ``action=\"cancel\"`` cancels by ``job_id``. The target is "
"locked to the caller. Validation failures (``cancel`` missing ``job_id``) are wrapped by ``Tool.__call__`` "
"into a ``status=\"error\"`` result."

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ManageCronTool:11 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``list`` 返回 ``{\"jobs\": [CronJob dict…]}``（仅 caller 的任务）；"
msgstr "``list`` returns ``{\"jobs\": [CronJob dict…]}`` (only the caller's jobs);"

#: flowing.plugins.cron.tools.ManageCronTool:12 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``cancel`` 返回 ``{\"cancelled\": bool}``（不存在返回 ``False``， 与 "
":func:`flowing.plugins.cron.unschedule` 语义一致）。"
msgstr ""
"``cancel`` returns ``{\"cancelled\": bool}`` (``False`` if it does not exist, consistent with "
